OL,3,ABritish rapper Sway dies aged 44
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe award-winning British-Ghanaian rap
OL,6,Fartist Sway DaSafo has died at the age
OL,7,Fof 44.
OL,9,FHe was the first unsigned rapper to win
OL,10,Fa Mobo Award in 2006, and scored a top
OL,11,F10 hit in 2012 with the single Level
OL,12,FUp.
OL,14,FThe news was first shared online by the
OL,15,FMobo organisation, and confirmed to the
OL,16,FBBC by the musician's friend Kash
OL,17,FAhmad, who said he died at his home in
OL,18,FGhana.
OL,20,FNo cause of death has been announced.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
